        "The rest of the bus shifted in their seats, some offering their two cents.",
        "\"Hey, why don't you just move, she's been quiet the whole time.\"",
        '"Do we really need the police for this?"',
        "One overly concerned woman did call the police. Everyone on the bus, myself included, had a collective moment of head-shaking and face-palming. Although we were already running late, we now had to wait for the police to arrive and resolve the ruckus.",
        "The bus driver made her way over and requested that the man, the father, and his daughter step off the bus. The father and daughter cooperated, the older man insisted on staying.",
        '"If you need to talk to me talk to me here."',
        "Ten minutes later the police showed up.",
        '"Sir, I need you to get off the bus so I can talk to you."',
        '"I didn\'t do anything!"',
        '"Sir, I was told by the bus staff that you were fighting with the man outside."',
        '"You don\'t know shit!"',
