        "Surprisingly we made our transfer to the Atlanta bus on time. I slept through the night and by 8:00 am the following morning we were in Atlanta. Eve's aunt and uncle Sharlene and Larry (truly amazing people) were waiting for us at the bus stop and treated us to breakfast after they picked us up. We've spent the day making final preparations for the trip, and plan to be on the trail by 9:00 am tomorrow.",
