        "Glancing around with my headlamp, it became apparent that every little nook and cranny about the shelter was packed with nests. I did my best to ignore them but every 20 minutes one would scamper by my face. Eventually, I completely lost my mind and began stabbing with my pole at all the little holes whilst screaming like a lunatic in an attempt to destroy the furry demons. I was not in the least bit successful.",
