        "Hopeful to catch up I quickly proceeded north, passing a tree littered with abandoned footwear. It wasn't long before I encountered Uff Da. Uff Da was 33 and from Fargo, North Dakota. He explained to me that he had been planning to hike the Appalachian Trail for over a decade and finally decided to go for it before attending law school in the fall. He planned to make his way to Maine at a modest pace, making sure to stay in every town and soak up as much of the trail as possible before it was over.",
